## Step 8 — Install dev staples

### git & GitHub CLI
```bash
brew install git gh
```

### AWS CLI
> Install via the official pkg installer — avoids Python conflicts with brew.

```bash
curl "https://awscli.amazonaws.com/AWSCLIV2.pkg" -o "AWSCLIV2.pkg"
sudo installer -pkg AWSCLIV2.pkg -target /
rm AWSCLIV2.pkg
```

Verify:
```bash
aws --version
```

### Terraform
Follow the official HashiCorp install guide:
https://developer.hashicorp.com/terraform/tutorials/aws-get-started/install-cli

Verify:
```bash
terraform --version
```

