## Key bindings

| Key | Action |
|---|---|
| `Ctrl+R` | Fuzzy search command history |
| `Ctrl+T` | Fuzzy search files in current dir |
| `Alt+C` | Fuzzy cd into a subdirectory |
| `→` right arrow | Accept autosuggestion |
| `z foo` | Jump to most-used dir matching "foo" |
| `zi` | Interactive fuzzy jump with zoxide |

