## What shows in the prompt

- Current directory (dimmed, truncated to 3 levels)
- Git branch name
- Git status — `~` modified, `+` staged, `?` untracked, `⇡⇣` ahead/behind remote
- Python venv name when active
- `❯` green on success, red on error

